sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client as Authenticated client
  participant Action as Convex action
  participant Owner as requireOwner
  participant Machine as XState v6 machine
  participant Provider as Firecrawl / Treg / TypeSafe
  participant DB as Convex tables

  Client->>Action: start or advance workflow
  Action->>Owner: getUserIdentity()
  Owner-->>Action: owner identity
  Action->>DB: load owned run
  Action->>Machine: restore state and context
  Machine-->>Action: current snapshot
  Action->>Provider: perform one external operation
  Provider-->>Action: typed result or error
  Action->>Machine: send typed event
  Machine-->>Action: next snapshot
  Action->>DB: persist state and context
  Action-->>Client: run view or queue item
